    "notes": "No library source was read for this file (cmdk and kbar were not downloaded): bindings are the combobox and dialog contracts plus common convention. ArrowLeft and ArrowRight are unbound and stay with the caret, so nothing is direction-sensitive. Arabic-first: the open shortcut is matched on the physical key (KeyboardEvent.code \"KeyK\"), because with an Arabic layout active the K key produces a different character; shortcuts shown next to commands use the platform's modifier names and stay left-to-right; fuzzy matching runs on normalised Arabic text."
